      "ordinal": 1,
      "source": "But despite his hard words, his eyes settle on yours. Studying. Deciding. His mouth settles into an irritated line.  \r\n\r\n\"Look,\" he says, running a hand over his stubbled scalp. \"You hide it well, but I can tell you're new here. I ent trying to offend you, but I... don't like leaving folk new to Sagus on their own. If you have questions about the city - or Circus Minor in particular - I'll answer 'em, free of charge.\"",
      "translation": "但尽管他话说得硬，他的目光却落在你身上。端详。斟酌。他的嘴抿成一条烦躁的直线。  \r\n\r\n“听着，”他说，一只手抚过布满胡茬的头皮。“你掩饰得很好，但我看得出来你是新来的。我不是想冒犯你，只是我……不喜欢让初到萨古斯的人独自待着。如果你对这座城市——或者尤其是小竞技场——有什么问题，我会回答，不收钱。”",
      "stage": "translate"
    },
    {
